{
  "schema_version": "pdd.native-cases.v1",
  "story_path": "user_stories/compact-draft-interface.md",
  "criteria": [{"id": "AC1", "text": "`pdd test --fill-hash --compact` fills draft hashes and removes interface JSON formatting whitespace, including in drafts whose hashes are already current; it lists compacted paths and counts and exits 0 when nothing refuses or is stale."}, {"id": "AC2", "text": "Compaction preserves every field, member order, number spelling, escape and string byte; only the usual hash string and whitespace between JSON tokens may change, while prose, fences, wrappers and approval status stay exact."}, {"id": "AC3", "text": "Running compaction again on a compact current draft changes nothing; ordinary `pdd test --fill-hash` retains its hash-only output, result shape and formatting behavior."}, {"id": "AC4", "text": "Approved, statusless, malformed, multiple-block and unsafe-to-fill prompts stay unchanged with the existing current, stale, warning or refusal outcome; refusals or stale approved hashes retain exit 4."}, {"id": "AC5", "text": "For execution, `--compact` without `--fill-hash`, with a Story, or with another mode or option exits 2 before any write, sign-in, network request or AI call. Existing local help requests still show help without execution."}, {"id": "AC6", "text": "The command needs no tests, sign-in, network request or AI call, applies in every directory, and the former `pdd check` name performs the same work with its existing notice."}],
  "binding": {"preflight": "src/runtime-preflight.mjs:fillHashes", "handler": "src/runtime-client.mjs:runCheck", "cli": "bin/pdd.mjs"},
  "fixture": {"prefix": "# Compact interface\n\nKeep prose bytes.\n\n", "block_prefix": "<details><summary>Runtime interface</summary>\n\n```json\n", "block_suffix": "\n```\n</details>", "suffix": "\nOutside stays.\n", "expected_prose_sha256": "1f388b8331e3541a5b2d9233b1e33d9709ad0187c5bead3dcf717d912c818f3d", "assembly": "prefix + (block_prefix + before_body + block_suffix) repeated block_count times + suffix. Each case uses a fresh temporary Git repository with no tests. Preserve all bytes outside the root JSON span. Expected single-block source substitutes only expected_body; these are independently authored literal strings."},
  "replay_rules": ["Replay all cases through fillHashes and pdd test; replay one success and one refusal through the check alias. Its only extra output is its existing stderr notice. Direct runCheck fetch and gh spy counts are 0; create no runtime state or AI call.", "Result arrays contain {path} records; refused/warnings additionally have message matching message_contains. Hash outcome arrays are mutually exclusive per file. Only compact=true adds compacted. Test ordinary fill with compact omitted and false; compare exact five-field result shape.", "CLI group order: warnings, filled, opt-in compacted, refusals, stale, opt-in compact summary, final hash summary. Success lines: Filled prose_sha256: PATH and Compacted Runtime interface: PATH. Summaries: Interfaces: N compacted. then Hashes: F filled, C current, R refused, S stale. Each line ends in LF.", "Rerun successful compaction: zero writes, compacted [], filled [], current [{path}], exact same bytes. Mix a safe draft and a refused file: keep successful edits and exit 4. Retain all existing hash-only vectors and bounded checks unchanged.", "Formal native bounds: all 6 existing statuses x 4 hashes x 3 directories with compact false/true; also exercise token whitespace and escaped quote/backslash parity. Use a Story-derived oracle and assertion-detect an intentional string-whitespace deletion or approved-file compaction. No Runtime pass is implied."],
  "cases": [
    {"id": "pretty-draft", "criteria": ["AC1", "AC2", "AC6"], "path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md", "compact": true, "before_body": "{\n        \"status\": \"draft\",\n        \"prose_sha256\": \"\",\n        \"entries\": [],\n        \"calls\": [],\n        \"resources\": [],\n        \"limits\": { \"max_steps\": 1, \"max_model_calls\": 1 },\n        \"conventions\": []\n}", "block_count": 1, "expected_body": "{\"status\":\"draft\",\"prose_sha256\":\"1f388b8331e3541a5b2d9233b1e33d9709ad0187c5bead3dcf717d912c818f3d\",\"entries\":[],\"calls\":[],\"resources\":[],\"limits\":{\"max_steps\":1,\"max_model_calls\":1},\"conventions\":[]}", "expected_outcome": "filled", "expected_compacted": true, "exit_code": 0, "expected_writes": 1, "expected_result": {"filled": [{"path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md"}], "current": [], "refused": [], "stale": [], "warnings": [], "compacted": [{"path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md"}]}},
    {"id": "lexical-bytes", "criteria": ["AC2", "AC6"], "path": "examples/subject.prompt.md", "compact": true, "before_body": "{ \"status\" : \"draft\", \"prose_sha256\" : \"\", \"note\" : \"keep  spaces, \\\\ path, \\\"quote\\\", \\n and \\t, \\u0041, \\/\", \"large\" : 9007199254740993, \"exponent\" : 1e+03, \"negative_zero\" : -0, \"dup\" : 1, \"dup\" : 2, \"__proto__\" : { \"x\" : 1 } }", "block_count": 1, "expected_body": "{\"status\":\"draft\",\"prose_sha256\":\"1f388b8331e3541a5b2d9233b1e33d9709ad0187c5bead3dcf717d912c818f3d\",\"note\":\"keep  spaces, \\\\ path, \\\"quote\\\", \\n and \\t, \\u0041, \\/\",\"large\":9007199254740993,\"exponent\":1e+03,\"negative_zero\":-0,\"dup\":1,\"dup\":2,\"__proto__\":{\"x\":1}}", "expected_outcome": "filled", "expected_compacted": true, "exit_code": 0, "expected_writes": 1, "expected_result": {"filled": [{"path": "examples/subject.prompt.md"}], "current": [], "refused": [], "stale": [], "warnings": [], "compacted": [{"path": "examples/subject.prompt.md"}]}},
    {"id": "current-draft", "criteria": ["AC1", "AC2", "AC6"], "path": "test/fixtures/subject.prompt.md", "compact": true, "before_body": "{\n        \"status\": \"draft\",\n        \"prose_sha256\": \"1f388b8331e3541a5b2d9233b1e33d9709ad0187c5bead3dcf717d912c818f3d\",\n        \"entries\": [],\n        \"calls\": [],\n        \"resources\": [],\n        \"limits\": { \"max_steps\": 1, \"max_model_calls\": 1 },\n        \"conventions\": []\n}", "block_count": 1, "expected_body": "{\"status\":\"draft\",\"prose_sha256\":\"1f388b8331e3541a5b2d9233b1e33d9709ad0187c5bead3dcf717d912c818f3d\",\"entries\":[],\"calls\":[],\"resources\":[],\"limits\":{\"max_steps\":1,\"max_model_calls\":1},\"conventions\":[]}", "expected_outcome": "current", "expected_compacted": true, "exit_code": 0, "expected_writes": 1, "expected_result": {"filled": [], "current": [{"path": "test/fixtures/subject.prompt.md"}], "refused": [], "stale": [], "warnings": [], "compacted": [{"path": "test/fixtures/subject.prompt.md"}]}},
    {"id": "compact-current", "criteria": ["AC3", "AC6"], "path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md", "compact": true, "before_body": "{\"status\":\"draft\",\"prose_sha256\":\"1f388b8331e3541a5b2d9233b1e33d9709ad0187c5bead3dcf717d912c818f3d\",\"entries\":[],\"calls\":[],\"resources\":[],\"limits\":{\"max_steps\":1,\"max_model_calls\":1},\"conventions\":[]}", "block_count": 1, "expected_body": "{\"status\":\"draft\",\"prose_sha256\":\"1f388b8331e3541a5b2d9233b1e33d9709ad0187c5bead3dcf717d912c818f3d\",\"entries\":[],\"calls\":[],\"resources\":[],\"limits\":{\"max_steps\":1,\"max_model_calls\":1},\"conventions\":[]}", "expected_outcome": "current", "expected_compacted": false, "exit_code": 0, "expected_writes": 0, "expected_result": {"filled": [], "current": [{"path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md"}], "refused": [], "stale": [], "warnings": [], "compacted": []}},
    {"id": "hash-only-default", "criteria": ["AC3", "AC6"], "path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md", "compact": false, "before_body": "{\n        \"status\": \"draft\",\n        \"prose_sha256\": \"\",\n        \"entries\": [],\n        \"calls\": [],\n        \"resources\": [],\n        \"limits\": { \"max_steps\": 1, \"max_model_calls\": 1 },\n        \"conventions\": []\n}", "block_count": 1, "expected_body": "{\n        \"status\": \"draft\",\n        \"prose_sha256\": \"1f388b8331e3541a5b2d9233b1e33d9709ad0187c5bead3dcf717d912c818f3d\",\n        \"entries\": [],\n        \"calls\": [],\n        \"resources\": [],\n        \"limits\": { \"max_steps\": 1, \"max_model_calls\": 1 },\n        \"conventions\": []\n}", "expected_outcome": "filled", "expected_compacted": false, "exit_code": 0, "expected_writes": 1, "expected_result": {"filled": [{"path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md"}], "current": [], "refused": [], "stale": [], "warnings": []}},
    {"id": "approved-current", "criteria": ["AC4", "AC6"], "path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md", "compact": true, "before_body": "{\n        \"status\": \"approved\",\n        \"prose_sha256\": \"1f388b8331e3541a5b2d9233b1e33d9709ad0187c5bead3dcf717d912c818f3d\",\n        \"entries\": [],\n        \"calls\": [],\n        \"resources\": [],\n        \"limits\": { \"max_steps\": 1, \"max_model_calls\": 1 },\n        \"conventions\": []\n}", "block_count": 1, "expected_body": "{\n        \"status\": \"approved\",\n        \"prose_sha256\": \"1f388b8331e3541a5b2d9233b1e33d9709ad0187c5bead3dcf717d912c818f3d\",\n        \"entries\": [],\n        \"calls\": [],\n        \"resources\": [],\n        \"limits\": { \"max_steps\": 1, \"max_model_calls\": 1 },\n        \"conventions\": []\n}", "expected_outcome": "current", "expected_compacted": false, "exit_code": 0, "expected_writes": 0, "expected_result": {"filled": [], "current": [{"path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md"}], "refused": [], "stale": [], "warnings": [], "compacted": []}},
    {"id": "approved-stale", "criteria": ["AC4", "AC6"], "path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md", "compact": true, "before_body": "{\n        \"status\": \"approved\",\n        \"prose_sha256\": \"\",\n        \"entries\": [],\n        \"calls\": [],\n        \"resources\": [],\n        \"limits\": { \"max_steps\": 1, \"max_model_calls\": 1 },\n        \"conventions\": []\n}", "block_count": 1, "expected_body": "{\n        \"status\": \"approved\",\n        \"prose_sha256\": \"\",\n        \"entries\": [],\n        \"calls\": [],\n        \"resources\": [],\n        \"limits\": { \"max_steps\": 1, \"max_model_calls\": 1 },\n        \"conventions\": []\n}", "expected_outcome": "stale", "expected_compacted": false, "exit_code": 4, "expected_writes": 0, "expected_result": {"filled": [], "current": [], "refused": [], "stale": [{"path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md"}], "warnings": [], "compacted": []}},
    {"id": "statusless", "criteria": ["AC4", "AC6"], "path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md", "compact": true, "before_body": "{ \"metadata\" : [ \"keep  spaces\" ] }", "block_count": 1, "expected_body": "{ \"metadata\" : [ \"keep  spaces\" ] }", "expected_outcome": "warnings", "expected_compacted": false, "exit_code": 0, "expected_writes": 0, "message_contains": ["no status", "no prose_sha256", "skipped"]},
    {"id": "hash-without-status", "criteria": ["AC4", "AC6"], "path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md", "compact": true, "before_body": "{ \"prose_sha256\" : \"\" }", "block_count": 1, "expected_body": "{ \"prose_sha256\" : \"\" }", "expected_outcome": "refused", "expected_compacted": false, "exit_code": 4, "expected_writes": 0, "message_contains": ["no status"]},
    {"id": "unknown-status", "criteria": ["AC4", "AC6"], "path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md", "compact": true, "before_body": "{ \"status\" : \"pending\", \"prose_sha256\" : \"\" }", "block_count": 1, "expected_body": "{ \"status\" : \"pending\", \"prose_sha256\" : \"\" }", "expected_outcome": "refused", "expected_compacted": false, "exit_code": 4, "expected_writes": 0, "message_contains": ["status"]},
    {"id": "malformed", "criteria": ["AC4", "AC6"], "path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md", "compact": true, "before_body": "{", "block_count": 1, "expected_body": "{", "expected_outcome": "refused", "expected_compacted": false, "exit_code": 4, "expected_writes": 0, "message_contains": ["not valid JSON"]},
    {"id": "non-object", "criteria": ["AC4", "AC6"], "path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md", "compact": true, "before_body": "[]", "block_count": 1, "expected_body": "[]", "expected_outcome": "refused", "expected_compacted": false, "exit_code": 4, "expected_writes": 0, "message_contains": ["not a JSON object"]},
    {"id": "missing-hash", "criteria": ["AC4", "AC6"], "path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md", "compact": true, "before_body": "{ \"status\" : \"draft\" }", "block_count": 1, "expected_body": "{ \"status\" : \"draft\" }", "expected_outcome": "refused", "expected_compacted": false, "exit_code": 4, "expected_writes": 0, "message_contains": ["no \"prose_sha256\" key"]},
    {"id": "nonstring-hash", "criteria": ["AC4", "AC6"], "path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md", "compact": true, "before_body": "{ \"status\" : \"draft\", \"prose_sha256\" : null }", "block_count": 1, "expected_body": "{ \"status\" : \"draft\", \"prose_sha256\" : null }", "expected_outcome": "refused", "expected_compacted": false, "exit_code": 4, "expected_writes": 0, "message_contains": ["could not fill"]},
    {"id": "ambiguous-hash", "criteria": ["AC4", "AC6"], "path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md", "compact": true, "before_body": "{ \"status\" : \"draft\", \"prose_sha256\" : \"\", \"nested\" : { \"prose_sha256\" : \"\" } }", "block_count": 1, "expected_body": "{ \"status\" : \"draft\", \"prose_sha256\" : \"\", \"nested\" : { \"prose_sha256\" : \"\" } }", "expected_outcome": "refused", "expected_compacted": false, "exit_code": 4, "expected_writes": 0, "message_contains": ["could not fill"]},
    {"id": "current-nested-hash", "criteria": ["AC1", "AC2", "AC6"], "path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md", "compact": true, "before_body": "{ \"status\" : \"draft\", \"prose_sha256\" : \"1f388b8331e3541a5b2d9233b1e33d9709ad0187c5bead3dcf717d912c818f3d\", \"nested\" : { \"prose_sha256\" : \"\" } }", "block_count": 1, "expected_body": "{\"status\":\"draft\",\"prose_sha256\":\"1f388b8331e3541a5b2d9233b1e33d9709ad0187c5bead3dcf717d912c818f3d\",\"nested\":{\"prose_sha256\":\"\"}}", "expected_outcome": "current", "expected_compacted": true, "exit_code": 0, "expected_writes": 1, "expected_result": {"filled": [], "current": [{"path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md"}], "refused": [], "stale": [], "warnings": [], "compacted": [{"path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md"}]}},
    {"id": "multiple-blocks", "criteria": ["AC4", "AC6"], "path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md", "compact": true, "before_body": "{\n        \"status\": \"draft\",\n        \"prose_sha256\": \"\",\n        \"entries\": [],\n        \"calls\": [],\n        \"resources\": [],\n        \"limits\": { \"max_steps\": 1, \"max_model_calls\": 1 },\n        \"conventions\": []\n}", "block_count": 2, "expected_body": "{\n        \"status\": \"draft\",\n        \"prose_sha256\": \"\",\n        \"entries\": [],\n        \"calls\": [],\n        \"resources\": [],\n        \"limits\": { \"max_steps\": 1, \"max_model_calls\": 1 },\n        \"conventions\": []\n}", "expected_outcome": "refused", "expected_compacted": false, "exit_code": 4, "expected_writes": 0, "message_contains": ["more than one Runtime interface"]},
    {"id": "crlf-between-tokens", "criteria": ["AC2", "AC6"], "path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md", "compact": true, "before_body": "{\r\n        \"status\": \"draft\",\r\n        \"prose_sha256\": \"\",\r\n        \"entries\": [],\r\n        \"calls\": [],\r\n        \"resources\": [],\r\n        \"limits\": { \"max_steps\": 1, \"max_model_calls\": 1 },\r\n        \"conventions\": []\r\n}", "block_count": 1, "expected_body": "{\"status\":\"draft\",\"prose_sha256\":\"1f388b8331e3541a5b2d9233b1e33d9709ad0187c5bead3dcf717d912c818f3d\",\"entries\":[],\"calls\":[],\"resources\":[],\"limits\":{\"max_steps\":1,\"max_model_calls\":1},\"conventions\":[]}", "expected_outcome": "filled", "expected_compacted": true, "exit_code": 0, "expected_writes": 1, "expected_result": {"filled": [{"path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md"}], "current": [], "refused": [], "stale": [], "warnings": [], "compacted": [{"path": "prompts/subject.prompt.md"}]}}
  ],
  "invalid_combinations": [
